86
00:02:22.923 --> 00:02:24.309
Telling a story in order.

87
00:02:25.559 --> 00:02:26.797
Use sequence words:

88
00:02:27.077 --> 00:02:27.823
First...

89
00:02:28.103 --> 00:02:28.786
Then...

90
00:02:29.066 --> 00:02:30.026
After that...

91
00:02:30.306 --> 00:02:31.138
Suddenly...

92
00:02:31.418 --> 00:02:32.293
Finally...

93
00:02:33.643 --> 00:02:34.581
You could say:

94
00:02:34.861 --> 00:02:36.696
Yesterday I left home at 8.

95
00:02:36.976 --> 00:02:39.173
First, I took an auto to the station.

96
00:02:39.453 --> 00:02:41.800
Then I found that my train was two hours late.

97
00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:44.277
So I called my manager and told her.

98
00:02:44.557 --> 00:02:49.912
Finally, I worked from the station café and joined the 11 o'clock meeting on my phone.

