115
00:03:32.004 --> 00:03:32.964
Part 5.

116
00:03:33.244 --> 00:03:36.572
Conversation: reporting a problem at the hotel desk.

117
00:03:37.822 --> 00:03:39.849
Here is how the conversation goes.

118
00:03:40.129 --> 00:03:41.217
Good morning.

119
00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:43.801
I had a problem in my room last night.

120
00:03:44.081 --> 00:03:45.553
I'm sorry to hear that.

121
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:46.878
What happened?

122
00:03:47.158 --> 00:03:49.633
The AC stopped working at around midnight.

123
00:03:49.913 --> 00:03:52.899
I called the front desk, but nobody answered.

124
00:03:53.179 --> 00:03:54.459
I apologise.

125
00:03:54.739 --> 00:03:56.467
Did anyone come to check it?

126
00:03:56.747 --> 00:03:58.091
No, nobody came.

127
00:03:58.371 --> 00:04:01.166
I didn't sleep well because it was very hot.

128
00:04:02.516 --> 00:04:04.116
The conversation continues.

129
00:04:04.396 --> 00:04:05.655
I'm really sorry.

130
00:04:05.935 --> 00:04:07.407
Have you checked out yet?

131
00:04:07.687 --> 00:04:08.668
Not yet.

132
00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:10.719
I'm leaving at 11.

133
00:04:10.999 --> 00:04:12.556
I've informed the manager.

134
00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:15.673
We'll give you a 20% discount on last night's stay.

135
00:04:15.953 --> 00:04:17.916
Thank you, I appreciate that.

136
00:04:19.266 --> 00:04:20.205
Part 6.

