I (live) in Hyderabad in 2019.

157
00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.993
2. you ever (try) Kerala food?

158
00:05:03.273 --> 00:05:05.343
Oh no, I (forget) my ID card!

159
00:05:05.623 --> 00:05:06.327
4.

160
00:05:06.607 --> 00:05:07.951
We (meet) last Friday.

161
00:05:09.301 --> 00:05:10.218
Success:

162
00:05:10.498 --> 00:05:11.927
Answers. lived 2.

163
00:05:12.207 --> 00:05:16.154
Have... tried 3. have forgotten or I've forgotten 4. met.

164
00:05:17.504 --> 00:05:18.443
Part 7.

165
00:05:18.723 --> 00:05:19.768
Speak today.

166
00:05:21.018 --> 00:05:25.605
Tell someone what you did yesterday, in order, using First or Then or Finally.

167
00:05:25.885 --> 00:05:28.359
Ask 3 people a Have you ever...? question.

168
00:05:28.639 --> 00:05:32.565
Describe one problem from last week: what happened and what you did.

169
00:05:33.915 --> 00:05:35.451
That's the end of this lesson.

